        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b0eb662c-8711-5137-ab30-02b92047c0d5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Lianzhou, Yancheng, Guangdong Province, Jiangsu Province, Qingyuan, Lianjiang River, Xingzi Town, Yangshan, Yingde\n- People: Zuoxiao Zuzhou, Wu Hongjin\n- Roles: county-level city, prefecture-level city, musician, artist\n\nFacts:\n- Lianzhou, formerly called Lian County or Lianxian and postalized as Linhsien, is a county-level city in northern Guangdong Province, China, administered by the prefecture-level city of Qingyuan.\n- Yancheng is a prefecture-level city in northeastern Jiangsu Province, People's Republic of China.\n- The Lianjiang River rises at Momianshi in Xingzi Town in Lianzhou county and flows generally northwest to southeast through Lianzhou, Yangshan, and Yingde counties.\n- Zuoxiao Zuzhou, whose real name is Wu Hongjin, was born in Yancheng on March 4, 1970, and is a Chinese musician and artist.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
